      "design": "d3r2A",
      "good": "Fits the viewport; names and budget values remain visible and easy to locate. The risk column has room for several characters per line.",
      "problems": "Progress reads almost vertically, with percentages and UAT broken across lines. Long rows leave large empty areas beneath the short identifying fields.",
      "cause": "The 49px progress column leaves only 28px for text. The 99px risk column still requires extensive wrapping, which drives the tall rows."
